{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dusty is an intense multiplayer shooter where strategy, teamwork, and skill come together for thrilling combat. Players are divided into two fierce teams, <strong>Phantom</strong> and <strong>Blaze</strong>, battling it out across a variety of game modes: <strong>Capture the Flag</strong>, <strong>Team Deathmatch</strong>, and <strong>Free for All(More gamemodes will be added)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Capture the Flag</strong>, players work together to outmaneuver and outsmart the enemy team to secure the flag and score points. <strong>Team Deathmatch</strong> challenges each team to dominate the battlefield, trying to get more kills than enemy. For those who prefer the chaos of solo combat, <strong>Free for All</strong> throws players into an all-out battle, where it's every player for themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a tactician coordinating with teammates or a lone wolf aiming to be the last one standing, Dusty offers fast-paced action, intense firefights, and a variety of strategies to keep you on the edge of your seat. Join the fight, choose your team, and prove your dominance in the ultimate arena!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Died Nightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3541450/4abb1c0f7e9733eb2d6fae814b68f3177f4b5432.jpg"},{"name":"Start Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3541450/d0072b70216f85d1f939511636b8e4b538bacdeb.jpg"},{"name":"Happy Tombstone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3541450/9c8d261b9ae9a53086816590f96907ed3fa9f5eb.jpg"},{"name":"Nice Cheats","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3541450/7ce09d1b97fa7314894939d336419a3c2974ab20.jpg"},{"name":"Free For All","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3541450/b6f55b8392dcde3b9c71b9fecf8dc0be5f0c2644.jpg"},{"name":"Solo Hunter(Premium)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3541450/3b104cb62b2047ded8476dd9a9af2a9de4e7dc65.jpg"},{"name":"Team Death Match","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3541450/1d8ed7ae1f03dac3fd54b30544985476376a2b85.jpg"},{"name":"Airbase","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3541450/bee8e8a867c166c070b11698b1bcadaa224196c6.jpg"},{"name":"Team Work Win(Premium)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3541450/75d6e0615c34ee7b3dfc93a77dbe793037b5140f.jpg"},{"name":"Killer Breath(Premium)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3541450/0f0d58b9cc0cda4fad2697eb623671078f2a94d9.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3541450?t=1769510626","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3541450?t=1769510626","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541450/31831594fd72b189144f02d541d4142a6e498a41/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769510626","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541450/31831594fd72b189144f02d541d4142a6e498a41/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769510626","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dusty is an intense multiplayer shooter where strategy, teamwork, and skill come together for thrilling combat. Players are divided into two fierce teams, <strong>Phantom</strong> and <strong>Blaze</strong>, battling it out across a variety of game modes: <strong>Capture the Flag</strong>, <strong>Team Deathmatch</strong>, and <strong>Free for All(More gamemodes will be added)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Capture the Flag</strong>, players work together to outmaneuver and outsmart the enemy team to secure the flag and score points. <strong>Team Deathmatch</strong> challenges each team to dominate the battlefield, trying to get more kills than enemy. For those who prefer the chaos of solo combat, <strong>Free for All</strong> throws players into an all-out battle, where it's every player for themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a tactician coordinating with teammates or a lone wolf aiming to be the last one standing, Dusty offers fast-paced action, intense firefights, and a variety of strategies to keep you on the edge of your seat. Join the fight, choose your team, and prove your dominance in the ultimate arena!</p>","developers":["\u015eurup Games"],"dlc":[4145550],"ext_user_account_notice":"The game uses a database hosted on Hostinger for managing player accounts and storing game data. Players are required to create an account within the game to access its features. ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541450/ee42f6a0c745033866694af66ec904e917318a26/header.jpg?t=1769510626","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Legal Statement Regarding Intellectual Property Rights<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI, the undersigned, acting as the Licensor and developer of the game titled \"Dusty\", hereby declare the following:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1. All content used in the game \"Dusty\", including but not limited to 3D models, textures, music, sound effects, animations, code, and any other assets, are either:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n   - Originally created by our development team,  <br />\r\n   - Licensed for commercial use from verified sources (e.g., Unity Asset Store, sound libraries, etc.),  <b